  "details": "With the removal of the Launch Pad tab, there is no way to properly sort \"Recently Updated Favorites\". \n\nThe Launch Pad & Worlds tab \"Recently Updated Favorites (Worlds)\" section both sort wrongly ([old canny mention](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/world-menu-recently-updated-favorites-not-sorted-in-order-of-most-recently-updat)), but at least in the Launch Pad section there was a sorting button allowing me to forcefully re-sort it properly, but now this is not the case. \n\nHopefully this can now be fixed, or the sorting button can be added back.",
